blitzy-curl - LICENSE

This is the license of the blitzy-curl project. The repository holds three
trees: original/ (an unmodified vendored copy of upstream curl), refactor/
(the Rust implementation of libcurl and the curl command-line tool) and
testing/ (the project-authored verification code).

Section 1 below reproduces the upstream curl license verbatim. Section 2
states this project's licensing position. The vendored tree original/ keeps
its own license files, which this file leaves untouched; see "Preserved
baseline license" in Section 2.

